1
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:44,160
Xuan,

2
00:01:44,759 --> 00:01:46,400
why are we here this late?

3
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:49,560
Showing you the world.

4
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,479
They have shows at night?

5
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,080
Come on.

6
00:01:52,440 --> 00:01:53,240
You'll see soon.

7
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:56,680
Sixian,

8
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:58,920
what are you looking at?

9
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:01,800
I think…

10
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,120
I saw someone I know.

11
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:03,960
Relax.

12
00:02:04,320 --> 00:02:05,480
Xuan can handle it.

13
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,400
Don't worry.

14
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,960
Now, dear passenger,

15
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,280
stow your tray table,

16
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,840
return your seatback upright,

17
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:14,200
let's take off!

18
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,800
Sixian?

19
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:37,560
Ziyue.

20
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:38,880
It really is you!

21
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:42,560
What a coincidence.

22
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:44,240
Running into you here.

23
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:46,120
You…

24
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,079
How have you been?

25
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:48,800
Pretty good.

26
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,280
You off today?

27
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:53,360
I'm on domestic routes now.

28
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:54,920
Just two local flights,

29
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,000
much lighter.

30
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:59,360
It's been three years, hasn't it?

31
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:00,680
Not long ago,

32
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:02,320
I was talking about you

33
00:03:02,320 --> 00:03:03,000
with some of our old coworkers.

34
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:03,880
About me?

35
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:06,440
What's there to say?

36
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:07,800
Just…

37
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,560
we still feel it's a pity.

38
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:11,520
You're so smart and pretty.

39
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:12,200
Back then,

40
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:13,640
Wang Lekang liked you too, right?

41
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:15,120
You know,

42
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:17,760
if you hadn't quit impulsively,

43
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,480
you'd be a purser by now.

44
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:20,560
Maybe you would've

45
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,480
been moved into management.

46
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:24,680
But seeing you now,

47
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:25,800
so at ease,

48
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,480
it makes me happy.

49
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:28,680
You know,

50
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,160
being a flight attendant,

51
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:31,960
it's all glamour on the surface.

52
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,200
Truth is,

53
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:34,360
flipping days and nights,

54
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:35,760
it's pretty exhausting.

55
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:36,480
Sixian?

56
00:03:37,880 --> 00:03:38,320
Coming.

57
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:39,520
Ziyue,

58
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:41,320
I've got work to do.

59
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:41,880
I'll head off.

60
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:43,680
Hey, Sixian!

61
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:46,440
Let's catch up sometime.

62
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:48,880
There's always time.

63
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:03,240
What took so long?

64
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:04,720
You know who

65
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:05,400
I just ran into?

66
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:05,760
Who?

67
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:08,840
A coworker?

68
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,440
Never mind.

69
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,000
You wouldn't remember her.

70
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:15,080
By the way,

71
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:17,360
I've never been to Mingchen Apartments.

72
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:18,440
I heard

73
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:20,600
the pilots' quarters

74
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,839
are much better now.

75
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:22,480
Yes,

76
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:24,000
they are much better now.

77
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:27,000
Uh, but…

78
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:28,760
you can't go these two days.

79
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:29,720
It's a mess.

80
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:31,000
Then…

81
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,159
I'll go today

82
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,200
and tidy up for you.

83
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:35,480
Come on.

84
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,320
Today's plan

85
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:37,560
isn't about cleaning.

86
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,360
Besides, I'd never

87
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,080
make you do that.

88
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:41,159
I hired a cleaner.

89
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,360
Table's booked,

90
00:04:44,159 --> 00:04:44,680
let's go somewhere else.

91
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:46,960
Forget it.

92
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:49,520
I just remembered

93
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,159
I'm on standby in two days.

94
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:52,640
I should head back.

95
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:55,480
That's a shame.

96
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:56,800
I was hoping

97
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:57,800
we could celebrate.

98
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:02,480
Celebrate what?

99
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,520
The Z101 maiden flight.

100
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,040
And Jiang Ziyue,

101
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:08,680
as the purser

102
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:11,480
for the maiden flight,

103
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,360
don't you think

104
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,280
that's worth celebrating?

105
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,880
So the maiden flight crew is confirmed.

106
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:18,320
Why are you telling me now?

107
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:19,240
I wanted

108
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,240
to surprise you.

109
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:21,360
But looks like

110
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,520
the purser won't give me the chance.

111
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:23,920
Are you sure it's a surprise?

112
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:28,760
You'll see when we get there.

113
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:30,360
Let's go.

114
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:31,920
Don't lie to me.

115
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:32,760
I wouldn't.

116
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:35,159
Go.

117
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:51,120
She's gone?

118
00:05:51,760 --> 00:05:53,520
But I didn't see anyone come down.

119
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:56,480
Who didn't come down?

120
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,120
Mr. Fu.

121
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,320
You showing up in the middle of the night,

122
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:10,840
it's scary.

123
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:12,840
It's quite chilly.

124
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:15,840
Did I get a lot on my face?

125
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,040
Want to help me wipe it off first?

126
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:48,720
I think

127
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,800
it's evenly spread.

128
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:00,800
Aren't you on your period?

129
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:02,520
Why are you eating ice cream?

130
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:04,960
No cold stuff from now on.

131
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:11,960
Drink the porridge while it's hot.

132
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,640
There are heat packs

133
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:14,840
and painkillers inside.

134
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:16,200
Mr. Fu,

135
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:18,280
why

136
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:20,520
are you suddenly being so nice?

137
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:23,640
Caring for my staff.

138
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:24,960
Even so,

139
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:26,760
I'm still applying

140
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:28,320
to revise the campaign plan.

141
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:29,200
Alright.

142
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:31,440
I won't force you.

143
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:47,760
It's not that I'm uncooperative,

144
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:49,680
you withheld things first.

145
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,520
I won't force you.

146
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,000
It's not just because

147
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:57,640
I owe you first.

148
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:05,360
Owe me first?

149
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:07,800
Today?

150
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:12,880
He couldn't have remembered, could he?

151
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,160
Hengshi 5101,

152
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:18,560
runway 04, cleared to land.

153
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:20,280
Surface wind 330 at 5 meters.

154
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:22,840
Runway 04, cleared to land.

155
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:24,040
Hengshi 5101.

156
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,080
Landing clearance confirmed.

157
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,360
Left crosswind 10 knots.

158
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:28,800
Check.

159
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:30,520
Before landing checklist.

160
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:34,560
Before landing checklist.

161
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:35,280
ECAM

162
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:35,680
memo clear.

163
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:37,520
No blue.

164
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:38,480
Cabin.

165
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:39,640
Cabin secured.

166
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:41,160
Before landing checklist complete.

167
00:09:42,040 --> 00:09:42,680
[One hundred.]

168
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,080
[Fifty.]

169
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:49,080
[Forty.]

170
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:50,080
[Thirty.]

171
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:50,560
Hold it.

172
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:52,840
[Twenty.]

173
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:53,320
Right.

174
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:54,040
A bit more.

175
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:54,760
Yes.

176
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:55,720
Good.

177
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:56,720
Good.

178
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:10,840
Oh, instructor,

179
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,280
I forgot to tell you.

180
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:13,720
One morning,

181
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,200
I ran into the new female pilot.

182
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:16,080
Really?

183
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:17,600
What does she look like?

184
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,400
Forget her looks,

185
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:21,560
she said her name is Ruan Sixian.

186
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,200
Impossible.

187
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,240
You must have misheard.

188
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:25,240
No way.

189
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:26,920
We talked face to face.

190
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,560
She really said Ruan Sixian.

191
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:30,240
Absolutely impossible.

192
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,360
If you don't believe me,

193
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:33,280
tonight,

194
00:10:33,280 --> 00:10:34,200
I'll take you somewhere.

195
00:10:34,560 --> 00:10:35,280
All she does now

196
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:37,120
is pour coffee and serve drinks.

197
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:50,920
Instructor, thanks.

198
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,600
No wonder you're top of the academy.

199
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:54,600
Instructor,

200
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:56,320
if others say that, fine,

201
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,520
but you?

202
00:10:57,520 --> 00:10:58,440
I'm trained

203
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,640
by your own hands.

204
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,880
The maiden flight is almost here.

205
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:02,800
Keep practicing.

206
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:03,600
Get in the seat soon.

207
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:04,960
Got it.

208
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:07,000
We'll go over details in the debrief room.

209
00:11:14,280 --> 00:11:14,960
[Miss Ruan,]

210
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:15,960
[would you]

211
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,240
[do me the honor]

212
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:18,040
[of having dinner with me tonight?]

213
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:19,400
[Sixian,]

214
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:20,720
[Mr. Fu invites you]

215
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:21,880
[to dinner tonight.]

216
00:11:25,520 --> 00:11:27,200
Sure, Mr. Yan, see you tonight.

217
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:31,800
Sorry, Mr. Bai,

218
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:32,680
I have plans tonight.

219
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,840
In or out,

220
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,800
speak or don't.

221
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:55,040
Mr. Fu, here's the thing.

222
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:57,400
Miss Ruan said she has

223
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:58,760
plans tonight.

224
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:00,240
Then ask for tomorrow.

225
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:02,000
Well…

226
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:04,600
what if she has plans tomorrow too?

227
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:06,440
What do you mean?

228
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:07,360
I mean,

229
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:09,600
do we have a Plan B

230
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:11,320
for the maiden flight promo?

231
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:30,520
Send me Ruan Sixian's WeChat.

232
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:33,480
What are you asking me?

233
00:12:33,680 --> 00:12:34,720
Ruan Sixian…

234
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:39,480
Right, I got it.

235
00:12:44,320 --> 00:12:44,640
Mr. Fu,

236
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:45,280
well,

237
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:46,600
I've sent it to you.

238
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:49,200
I can see that.

239
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:12,640
Isn't that Yan An?

240
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:13,880
What brings him

241
00:13:13,880 --> 00:13:14,680
here today?

242
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:17,160
Is this the

243
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:18,400
female pilot he mentioned

244
00:13:18,400 --> 00:13:19,440
he's pursuing at the last gathering?

245
00:13:20,560 --> 00:13:21,120
Got to say,

246
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:22,880
they actually look good together.

247
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:39,840
Mr. Yan,

248
00:13:40,040 --> 00:13:41,600
someone already paid the bill.

249
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,320
Already paid?

250
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:44,360
Who?

251
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:45,720
That lady.

252
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,320
Miss Ruan.

253
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:53,440
I have never

254
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:54,200
let anyone

255
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:54,960
pick up my tab.

256
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:55,880
You can't be

257
00:13:55,880 --> 00:13:57,160
the one to break that.

258
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:58,680
Otherwise my reputation

259
00:13:58,680 --> 00:13:59,480
would be ruined.

260
00:14:00,880 --> 00:14:01,280
Mr. Yan,

261
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:03,760
you really know how to pick your friends.

262
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,560
Don't they feel any shame

263
00:14:05,560 --> 00:14:06,240
making you pick up the tab every time?

264
00:14:08,120 --> 00:14:09,600
Going with the formal tone?

265
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:10,720
Fine.

266
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:13,160
Then let me ask you, Miss Ruan,

267
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:15,280
when did you pay?

268
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:17,400
Was it when you went to the restroom,

269
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:18,560
or when you made that phone call?

270
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:20,880
This meal is to thank you, Mr. Yan,

271
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:23,160
for your appreciation back at the academy.

272
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:24,200
But you didn't come

273
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:25,200
to work at Bo'ao!

274
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:28,120
You let Fu Mingyu get you instead!

275
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:35,000
But let me tell you,

276
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:37,400
that man, Fu Mingyu,

277
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:38,720
is very dangerous.

278
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:39,760
You must

279
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:41,520
stay far away from him!

280
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:44,120
Then I should
definitely be the one paying.

281
00:14:44,680 --> 00:14:45,640
To be precise,

282
00:14:45,640 --> 00:14:46,920
it's Fu Mingyu's treat.

283
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:48,400
Because my money

284
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:50,200
all comes from his wallet.

285
00:14:50,640 --> 00:14:51,960
Does that make you feel better?

286
00:14:52,880 --> 00:14:54,520
That actually sounds good.

287
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:57,520
So, how about

288
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:58,280
finding another place

289
00:14:58,720 --> 00:14:59,120
for a drink?

290
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:00,760
I have training tomorrow,

291
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:01,360
I can't drink.

292
00:15:02,520 --> 00:15:03,160
Then let me drive you home.

293
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:04,040
Really, don't bother.

294
00:15:04,520 --> 00:15:05,480
I'm meeting my friend tonight,

295
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:06,120
got some things to do.

296
00:15:06,520 --> 00:15:07,720
Let's meet another time.

297
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:09,640
Alright.

298
00:15:10,880 --> 00:15:11,880
I'll wait for you to ask me next time.

299
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:23,920
Am I late?

300
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:25,280
Enjoy your meal.

301
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:26,760
No worries.

302
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:28,080
It's pretty dead anyway,

303
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:29,320
I was about to close up early.

304
00:15:29,680 --> 00:15:30,360
But,

305
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:32,680
Xiaozhen seems to
have something to tell you.

306
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:38,240
Two things.

307
00:15:38,840 --> 00:15:39,680
First,

308
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:41,080
I have an early shift tomorrow.

309
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:42,680
Can I crash

310
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:44,520
at "Captain" Ruan's big place

311
00:15:44,520 --> 00:15:45,040
for the night?

312
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:48,520
Sure.

313
00:15:48,760 --> 00:15:50,320
You're the best!

314
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:53,480
Then,

315
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:54,400
the second thing is

316
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:55,760
to thank you.

317
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:58,960
My parents got me a new car!

318
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:00,280
I'm driving tonight,

319
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:01,360
taking "Captain" Ruan home!

320
00:16:01,480 --> 00:16:01,760
Let's go!

321
00:16:04,160 --> 00:16:04,800
Maybe…

322
00:16:06,040 --> 00:16:07,400
we should take a cab.

323
00:16:08,640 --> 00:16:10,040
I can't fly a plane,

324
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:11,280
but I can drive, okay?

325
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:12,160
Trust me.

326
00:16:12,520 --> 00:16:13,720
I passed the driving test first try.

327
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:14,320
Come on!

328
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:16,640
"Captain" Ruan, good luck!

329
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:17,520
Relax!

330
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:18,960
Come on, get in!

331
00:16:28,640 --> 00:16:28,960
Xuan,

332
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:30,200
why are we

333
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:31,240
here this late?

334
00:16:32,760 --> 00:16:33,760
Showing you the world.

335
00:16:35,240 --> 00:16:36,680
They have shows at night?

336
00:16:37,360 --> 00:16:37,600
Come on.

337
00:16:37,960 --> 00:16:38,800
You'll see soon.

338
00:16:42,400 --> 00:16:44,240
Now, dear passenger,

339
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:45,560
stow your tray table,

340
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:47,120
return your seatback upright,

341
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:48,480
let's take off!

342
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:38,840
What was that?

343
00:17:39,560 --> 00:17:40,760
Don't scare me.

344
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:42,040
I just got this car.

345
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:43,480
Go check it.

346
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:45,520
I'm scared.

347
00:18:32,640 --> 00:18:33,360
One good thing,

348
00:18:33,360 --> 00:18:34,080
one bad thing.

349
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:36,040
Just say both.

350
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:37,400
Good news,

351
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:39,800
your car is perfectly fine.

352
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:40,880
Really?

353
00:18:42,520 --> 00:18:43,440
Bad news,

354
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:45,760
you hit this one.

355
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:54,360
What… what car is that?

356
00:18:56,120 --> 00:18:56,560
Sixian,

357
00:18:57,320 --> 00:18:58,360
is it too late

358
00:18:58,360 --> 00:18:59,200
to run?

359
00:18:59,360 --> 00:19:00,040
Not at all.

360
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:01,800
But if money can fix it,

361
00:19:01,800 --> 00:19:02,680
why go to jail?

362
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:03,320
The thing is,

363
00:19:03,320 --> 00:19:04,680
if it takes money to solve,

364
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:06,320
I'm out of luck.

365
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:07,320
Might as well

366
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:08,320
call the insurance company

367
00:19:08,320 --> 00:19:09,240
and try?

368
00:19:16,240 --> 00:19:17,040
Hello, Mr. Yan.

369
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:18,360
[Miss Ruan, are you home yet?]

370
00:19:21,200 --> 00:19:22,280
Actually, I need

371
00:19:22,280 --> 00:19:23,320
to ask you something.

372
00:19:24,320 --> 00:19:24,600
Go ahead.

373
00:19:25,960 --> 00:19:27,080
[There's a]

374
00:19:27,080 --> 00:19:29,200
[black, convertible luxury car]

375
00:19:30,160 --> 00:19:32,080
[with plate number 1111,]

376
00:19:32,080 --> 00:19:32,640
[whose is it?]

377
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:34,760
[Isn't that]

378
00:19:34,760 --> 00:19:36,120
[Fu Mingyu's black Rolls-Royce?]

379
00:19:36,360 --> 00:19:37,480
[Miss Ruan, that car]

380
00:19:37,480 --> 00:19:40,080
[was my dream ride!]

381
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:41,040
[That guy snatched it]

382
00:19:41,040 --> 00:19:41,520
[from me!]

383
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:42,360
[I was furious!]

384
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:45,560
Got it.

385
00:19:45,800 --> 00:19:47,240
[I've got something to handle,]

386
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:47,800
[I'll hang up now.]

387
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:55,600
You're doomed.

388
00:19:56,360 --> 00:19:57,080
It's Fu Mingyu's car.

389
00:19:58,320 --> 00:19:59,400
Mr. Fu's car?

390
00:20:02,800 --> 00:20:03,200
Well…

391
00:20:04,480 --> 00:20:06,120
maybe there is hope.

392
00:20:06,360 --> 00:20:07,760
Better pray for yourself.

393
00:20:07,760 --> 00:20:08,600
Hope?

394
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:12,400
Why did it have to be him?

395
00:20:32,280 --> 00:20:33,480
What do we do now?

396
00:20:34,280 --> 00:20:35,160
Here's the drink menu.

397
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:38,600
Hey, handsome,

398
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:40,520
can I ask you something?

399
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:41,240
Sure.

400
00:20:42,080 --> 00:20:42,760
Does this place have

401
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:45,120
a server named Ruan Sixian?

402
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:49,200
Yeah, why?

403
00:20:50,960 --> 00:20:52,080
Nothing, just asking.

404
00:20:53,600 --> 00:20:54,880
I'll have sparkling water.

405
00:20:55,520 --> 00:20:55,880
Sure.

406
00:20:56,040 --> 00:20:57,080
Same for me.

407
00:20:57,200 --> 00:20:57,920
Okay, coming right up.

408
00:21:00,120 --> 00:21:00,920
Told you I wasn't lying.

409
00:21:41,920 --> 00:21:42,440
Who hit it?

410
00:21:45,040 --> 00:21:46,080
It was me.

411
00:21:47,280 --> 00:21:49,000
Mr. Fu, I didn't mean to!

412
00:21:50,800 --> 00:21:51,440
I'll pay!

413
00:21:51,640 --> 00:21:52,480
Definitely!

414
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:54,040
You don't have to.

415
00:21:54,360 --> 00:21:54,920
Did you call insurance?

416
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:56,960
I haven't had time.

417
00:21:58,400 --> 00:21:59,560
You really don't want me to pay?

418
00:22:02,320 --> 00:22:03,440
Ruan Sixian's salary is high,

419
00:22:03,520 --> 00:22:04,440
she can afford it.

420
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:12,720
Don't worry about it.

421
00:22:12,920 --> 00:22:13,760
I'll use my insurance.

422
00:22:14,120 --> 00:22:15,120
I'm heading back if nothing else.

423
00:22:15,120 --> 00:22:16,120
Just… leaving?

424
00:22:17,080 --> 00:22:17,760
Mr. Fu, take care!

425
00:22:19,680 --> 00:22:20,640
He said not to worry.

426
00:22:20,760 --> 00:22:21,120
Let's go.

427
00:22:21,360 --> 00:22:21,600
Go.

428
00:22:21,920 --> 00:22:22,760
Go where?

429
00:22:22,760 --> 00:22:23,760
It's not over yet!

430
00:22:23,760 --> 00:22:24,640
You think you can just leave?

431
00:22:24,800 --> 00:22:25,280
Just wait!

432
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:27,240
Fine.

433
00:22:31,520 --> 00:22:31,920
Still laughing?

434
00:22:34,080 --> 00:22:35,440
I never noticed before,

435
00:22:35,440 --> 00:22:36,720
he's actually quite nice.

436
00:22:37,240 --> 00:22:38,040
So calm and polite.

437
00:22:38,280 --> 00:22:39,800
Didn't even get mad at the damage.

438
00:22:43,360 --> 00:22:43,760
Wait.

439
00:22:45,440 --> 00:22:46,040
he doesn't seem

440
00:22:46,040 --> 00:22:47,480
like that type.

441
00:22:49,400 --> 00:22:50,520
He's not going to fire me, is he?

442
00:22:50,840 --> 00:22:51,360
Oh no.

443
00:22:52,280 --> 00:22:52,640
I'm done for.

444
00:22:57,520 --> 00:22:58,960
Looks like the insurance adjuster is here.

445
00:22:59,440 --> 00:23:01,120
Then go down and check.

446
00:23:10,120 --> 00:23:10,360
Here.

447
00:23:10,360 --> 00:23:10,680
Mr. Fu.

448
00:23:11,760 --> 00:23:12,920
Registration and license?

449
00:23:13,600 --> 00:23:14,360
Yeah, I've got them all.

450
00:23:14,360 --> 00:23:15,280
It's not serious.

451
00:23:15,760 --> 00:23:16,440
You can take a look,

452
00:23:16,440 --> 00:23:17,280
mainly the front side,

453
00:23:17,520 --> 00:23:18,480
and the rear of her vehicle.

454
00:23:19,440 --> 00:23:19,720
One moment,

455
00:23:19,720 --> 00:23:20,600
let me log her info first.

456
00:23:20,600 --> 00:23:21,040
Hold on.

457
00:23:21,880 --> 00:23:22,920
Here, keep this safe.

458
00:23:32,400 --> 00:23:33,560
Why are you back up?

459
00:23:35,200 --> 00:23:35,640
Move the car.

460
00:23:37,160 --> 00:23:37,920
Your friend's too scared to.

461
00:24:02,160 --> 00:24:02,440
Come on,

462
00:24:05,840 --> 00:24:06,720
it's just moving the car.

463
00:24:07,520 --> 00:24:08,200
Is that necessary?

464
00:24:09,520 --> 00:24:10,720
"Captain" Ruan, don't you have

465
00:24:10,840 --> 00:24:11,560
any safety awareness?

466
00:24:14,560 --> 00:24:15,920
That beeping is messing with my head.

467
00:24:29,040 --> 00:24:30,120
When I came upstairs just now,

468
00:24:30,840 --> 00:24:32,040
I reconsidered it.

469
00:24:33,640 --> 00:24:34,400
About the compensation,

470
00:24:35,160 --> 00:24:36,080
I can't just let it slide.

471
00:24:38,880 --> 00:24:39,760
Mr. Fu, what do you mean?

472
00:24:40,440 --> 00:24:41,560
A big boss like you

473
00:24:41,720 --> 00:24:43,040
going back on your word in minutes?

474
00:24:43,840 --> 00:24:44,320
Unless…

475
00:24:47,320 --> 00:24:47,880
Unless what?

476
00:24:48,560 --> 00:24:50,000
Unless you reconsider

477
00:24:50,880 --> 00:24:51,880
the promo shoot.

478
00:24:52,600 --> 00:24:53,320
Didn't I already

479
00:24:53,320 --> 00:24:54,400
tell you my answer, Mr. Fu?

480
00:24:57,000 --> 00:24:57,520
Yes, clearly.

481
00:24:58,920 --> 00:24:59,640
And I remember it all.

482
00:25:02,920 --> 00:25:04,480
About the previous promo shoot,

483
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:05,760
I admit I didn't

484
00:25:05,760 --> 00:25:07,160
give you enough personal respect.

485
00:25:07,520 --> 00:25:08,040
Nor did I give

486
00:25:08,040 --> 00:25:09,640
enough respect to the campaign

487
00:25:09,800 --> 00:25:10,600
for our domestic aircraft.

488
00:25:11,960 --> 00:25:12,840
I'll have the marketing team

489
00:25:13,200 --> 00:25:14,760
redesign a new campaign.

490
00:25:16,640 --> 00:25:18,080
But I hope you'll join,

491
00:25:18,800 --> 00:25:19,600
as a witness,

492
00:25:20,560 --> 00:25:21,040
and as

493
00:25:21,040 --> 00:25:22,240
an indispensable part of it.

494
00:25:23,080 --> 00:25:23,920
So you chose

495
00:25:23,920 --> 00:25:25,160
this moment to say all this,

496
00:25:25,960 --> 00:25:27,560
you're not using the car damage

497
00:25:27,560 --> 00:25:28,360
as leverage, are you?

498
00:25:30,320 --> 00:25:30,920
Seems like

499
00:25:31,320 --> 00:25:32,560
this is our only chance

500
00:25:32,560 --> 00:25:33,200
to sit down

501
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:34,560
and have a proper talk.

502
00:25:35,800 --> 00:25:36,920
About the promo shoot,

503
00:25:37,440 --> 00:25:37,920
I accept.

504
00:25:38,520 --> 00:25:39,600
And I fully respect

505
00:25:39,600 --> 00:25:40,440
your personal wishes.

506
00:25:41,320 --> 00:25:42,400
Cooperating with the shoot is

507
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:43,680
my duty as a Hengshi employee.

508
00:25:44,040 --> 00:25:45,480
I do have that much awareness.

509
00:25:46,560 --> 00:25:48,160
But I'd like to first see

510
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:49,160
the creative brief.

511
00:25:49,280 --> 00:25:50,360
The brief is actually

512
00:25:50,840 --> 00:25:52,080
still under wraps.

513
00:25:52,760 --> 00:25:53,920
But I can promise you

514
00:25:55,200 --> 00:25:56,520
this time, you won't be alone.

515
00:25:58,400 --> 00:25:59,520
No rush to answer me.

516
00:26:00,280 --> 00:26:01,200
I need

517
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:01,840
some time too

518
00:26:02,400 --> 00:26:03,000
to think it over.

519
00:26:04,680 --> 00:26:05,360
There's still a lot

520
00:26:06,400 --> 00:26:07,360
I haven't figured out.

521
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:14,960
But now it's fine,

522
00:26:16,800 --> 00:26:17,480
we have WeChat.

523
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:19,040
You can take your time.

524
00:26:25,680 --> 00:26:26,640
Who wants to

525
00:26:27,920 --> 00:26:28,640
"take my time…"

526
00:26:33,120 --> 00:26:35,160
♪I love bath time, skin so fine.♪

527
00:26:38,080 --> 00:26:39,080
♪So many bubbles.♪

528
00:26:39,960 --> 00:26:40,600
Who even invented

529
00:26:40,600 --> 00:26:41,400
this stuff?

530
00:26:41,640 --> 00:26:42,800
Watching cartoons as a kid,

531
00:26:42,800 --> 00:26:43,720
I thought it was exaggerated.

532
00:26:44,080 --> 00:26:45,480
Didn't know there'd be this many bubbles.

533
00:26:46,360 --> 00:26:47,320
So tell me,

534
00:26:47,760 --> 00:26:48,760
who invented you?

535
00:26:49,080 --> 00:26:50,600
One second you were shaking

536
00:26:50,600 --> 00:26:51,520
like a leaf,

537
00:26:51,600 --> 00:26:52,880
and now you're totally fine?

538
00:26:53,400 --> 00:26:54,480
Were you faking it?

539
00:26:54,480 --> 00:26:55,480
What are you talking about?

540
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:56,960
I was just

541
00:26:57,400 --> 00:26:58,720
a little nervous.

542
00:26:59,120 --> 00:26:59,840
Now it's perfect,

543
00:27:00,360 --> 00:27:01,480
a bath to calm my nerves

544
00:27:01,480 --> 00:27:02,600
and wash away the bad luck.

545
00:27:03,320 --> 00:27:04,240
Anyway,

546
00:27:04,240 --> 00:27:05,080
it's fine now.

547
00:27:05,520 --> 00:27:06,360
Remember this:

548
00:27:06,960 --> 00:27:08,840
Peace and quiet don't come free,

549
00:27:09,280 --> 00:27:11,840
someone's carrying the weight for you.

550
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:14,120
What do you mean?

551
00:27:14,880 --> 00:27:16,280
He's not making you pay, is he?

552
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:17,320
No, he's not.

553
00:27:18,200 --> 00:27:19,160
Then what were you two

554
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:20,200
talking about in the car

555
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:21,120
for so long?

556
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:23,800
He just wanted me

557
00:27:23,800 --> 00:27:24,880
to keep doing the shoot.

558
00:27:25,720 --> 00:27:26,400
Sixian,

559
00:27:27,160 --> 00:27:29,000
if you don't want to, don't do it.

560
00:27:29,800 --> 00:27:30,480
Anyway,

561
00:27:31,040 --> 00:27:32,440
worst case, we pay up.

562
00:27:32,800 --> 00:27:33,480
If it comes to it,

563
00:27:33,480 --> 00:27:34,760
I'll sell my car.

564
00:27:35,040 --> 00:27:36,160
I only bought it to

565
00:27:36,160 --> 00:27:37,240
save on cab fare.

566
00:27:37,840 --> 00:27:39,920
Turns out driving costs even more.

567
00:27:40,680 --> 00:27:41,560
Just don't let him

568
00:27:41,560 --> 00:27:42,920
hold this over you!

569
00:27:43,720 --> 00:27:44,360
He didn't

570
00:27:44,360 --> 00:27:46,000
threaten me with it.

571
00:27:46,400 --> 00:27:47,280
He didn't threaten you?

572
00:27:47,600 --> 00:27:48,320
That's exactly

573
00:27:48,320 --> 00:27:49,800
what's unsettling me.

574
00:27:50,440 --> 00:27:52,520
Something's off when it's too normal.

575
00:27:53,120 --> 00:27:55,200
Fu Mingyu's been way too

576
00:27:55,280 --> 00:27:56,480
out of character lately.

577
00:27:57,040 --> 00:27:58,440
Is it possible

578
00:27:58,440 --> 00:28:00,080
he's just a good person?

579
00:28:00,400 --> 00:28:01,640
Maybe everything before
was a misunderstanding.

580
00:28:02,560 --> 00:28:04,160
Thinking I wanted to be some mistress
of a house was a misunderstanding?

581
00:28:04,160 --> 00:28:05,000
Using benefits

582
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,400
to trick me into the shoot
was a misunderstanding?

583
00:28:06,400 --> 00:28:07,720
Which one did I get wrong?

584
00:28:07,720 --> 00:28:08,880
Well, I think

585
00:28:09,160 --> 00:28:10,080
you need to look at people

586
00:28:10,080 --> 00:28:12,080
with a developmental,
dialectical perspective.

587
00:28:12,240 --> 00:28:13,720
Take tonight for example…

588
00:28:13,720 --> 00:28:14,080
Go on.

589
00:28:14,960 --> 00:28:16,200
I'm curious to hear

590
00:28:16,360 --> 00:28:17,240
how you were being

591
00:28:17,240 --> 00:28:18,200
dialectical tonight.

592
00:28:18,600 --> 00:28:20,160
And I want to see how

593
00:28:20,520 --> 00:28:22,480
you're sitting in my bathtub

594
00:28:22,560 --> 00:28:23,680
taking his side.

595
00:28:23,840 --> 00:28:24,760
You saying that…

596
00:28:25,400 --> 00:28:26,280
am I really someone

597
00:28:26,280 --> 00:28:27,960
who cares about your scraps and favors?

598
00:28:28,480 --> 00:28:29,440
Whatever.

599
00:28:45,360 --> 00:28:45,960
[Tomorrow morning,]

