843
00:41:51,320 --> 00:41:51,840
But you,

844
00:41:52,520 --> 00:41:53,120
after graduation,

845
00:41:53,400 --> 00:41:54,600
you'll have to find an airline

846
00:41:54,960 --> 00:41:56,320
