849
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:02,520
Do you still want to learn?

850
00:42:04,680 --> 00:42:05,160
I do.

851
00:42:08,160 --> 00:42:09,200
At our academy,

852
00:42:09,320 --> 00:42:11,040
exam order is based

853
00:42:11,040 --> 00:42:12,360
