858
00:42:18,720 --> 00:42:20,400
Her effort speaks for itself.

859
00:42:20,680 --> 00:42:21,520
In the end,

860
00:42:22,280 --> 00:42:23,600
even with her back against the wall,

861
00:42:24,320 --> 00:42:25,280
she won that battle

862
00:42:25,400 --> 00:42:26,320
