863
00:42:26,720 --> 00:42:27,440
Besides,

864
00:42:28,240 --> 00:42:28,880
honestly,

865
00:42:29,560 --> 00:42:30,320
whatever our company's

866
00:42:30,320 --> 00:42:31,560
priorities may be,

867
00:42:32,040 --> 00:42:33,480
I sincerely thank you,

868
00:42:33,480 --> 00:42:33,840
Mr. Fu,

869
00:42:34,680 --> 00:42:36,640
