876
00:43:18,880 --> 00:43:19,760
[To learn to fly,]

877
00:43:20,720 --> 00:43:21,360
[she insisted]

878
00:43:21,360 --> 00:43:22,560
[on selling her own house.]

879
00:43:23,400 --> 00:43:24,240
[She started from behind,]

880
00:43:24,800 --> 00:43:25,320
[but she was still]

881
00:43:25,320 --> 00:43:26,720
